@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Menyimpan Link Google Drive Foto Mentah

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 4
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #999999
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #111111
    ActorBorderColor #999999
    ActorFontColor #111111
    BoxBorderColor #111111
    GroupBorderColor #111111
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
    DividerBorderColor #999999
    DividerFontColor #111111
}

actor "Fotografer" as Fotografer
boundary "Halaman Jadwal Tugas" as HalamanTugas
boundary "Detail Project" as DetailProject
boundary "Form Link Drive" as FormDrive
control "MediaAssetController" as MediaAssetController
control "NotificationService" as NotificationService
entity "Projects Model" as Project
entity "Bookings Model" as Booking

Fotografer -> HalamanTugas : Membuka daftar jadwal tugas
HalamanTugas -> MediaAssetController : request daftar project fotografer
MediaAssetController -> Project : ambil project terjadwal berdasarkan fotografer
Project --> MediaAssetController : data project
MediaAssetController --> HalamanTugas : tampilkan daftar project
HalamanTugas --> Fotografer : Menampilkan jadwal tugas

Fotografer -> HalamanTugas : Memilih project yang selesai sesi foto
HalamanTugas -> DetailProject : buka detail project
DetailProject -> MediaAssetController : request detail project
MediaAssetController -> Project : ambil detail project
Project -> Booking : ambil data booking
Booking --> Project : data booking
Project --> MediaAssetController : data project dan booking
MediaAssetController --> DetailProject : tampilkan detail project
DetailProject --> Fotografer : Menampilkan detail project

Fotografer -> Fotografer : Mengunggah foto mentah di luar sistem
Fotografer -> Fotografer : Link folder Google Drive
Fotografer -> DetailProject : Membuka form link Drive
DetailProject -> FormDrive : tampilkan form link Drive
Fotografer -> FormDrive : Mengisi link Google Drive foto mentah
Fotografer -> FormDrive : Klik simpan
FormDrive -> MediaAssetController : storeRawDriveLink(projectId, rawDriveUrl)

MediaAssetController -> Project : cek status project
Project --> MediaAssetController : hasil cek project
MediaAssetController -> Booking : cek status pembayaran
Booking --> MediaAssetController : hasil cek pembayaran
MediaAssetController -> MediaAssetController : validasi format link Google Drive
MediaAssetController -> MediaAssetController : validasi project terjadwal
MediaAssetController -> MediaAssetController : validasi pembayaran lunas

alt Project terjadwal, pembayaran lunas, dan link valid
    MediaAssetController -> Project : simpan link Drive foto mentah
    Project -> Project : update raw_drive_url,\nraw_drive_uploaded_by,\nraw_drive_uploaded_at,\nstatus SHOOT_DONE
    Project --> MediaAssetController : data project
    MediaAssetController -> NotificationService : kirim notifikasi link Drive ke klien
    NotificationService --> MediaAssetController : notifikasi terkirim
    MediaAssetController --> FormDrive : redirect dengan pesan berhasil
    FormDrive --> Fotografer : Link Drive berhasil disimpan
else Pembayaran belum lunas
    MediaAssetController --> FormDrive : tampilkan pesan pembayaran belum lunas
    FormDrive --> Fotografer : Link Drive tidak disimpan
else Project belum terjadwal
    MediaAssetController --> FormDrive : tampilkan pesan project belum terjadwal
    FormDrive --> Fotografer : Proses ditolak
else Link Google Drive tidak valid
    MediaAssetController --> FormDrive : tampilkan pesan link tidak valid
    FormDrive --> Fotografer : Perbaiki link Drive
end

@enduml
